WEBVTT

00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.609
A passenger enters at 9 a.m. Which greeting is appropriate

00:00:05.851 --> 00:00:12.472
Good morning Welcome on board Good morning accueille le matin good night sert

00:00:12.485 --> 00:00:14.360
généralement à prendre congé pour la nuit

00:00:15.855 --> 00:00:19.746
The passenger is opposite the hotel Where are they

00:00:21.951 --> 00:00:28.406
En face de l’hôtel Opposite indique un emplacement en face inside signifie à l’intérieur

00:00:29.891 --> 00:00:34.637
The customer asks Is parking included What do they want to know

00:00:36.891 --> 00:00:43.117
Si le stationnement est compris dans le prix Included signifie compris La réponse doit

00:00:43.129 --> 00:00:45.145
correspondre aux conditions réelles de l’offre

00:00:46.641 --> 00:00:49.804
Which phrase proposes tourist information without imposing it

00:00:52.058 --> 00:00:57.020
Would you like some information about the city Would you like vérifie l’intérêt du

00:00:57.033 --> 00:00:58.640
passager et respecte son choix
